      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**routers/admin.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import APIRouter, Depends\n\nfrom deps import require_key\n\nrouter = APIRouter(prefix=\"/admin\", tags=[\"admin\"], dependencies=[Depends(require_key)])\n\n\n@router.get(\"/stats\")\ndef stats():\n    return {\"books\": 2}\n\n\n@router.post(\"/reset\")\ndef reset():\n    return {\"reset\": True}\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**routers/admin.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import APIRouter, Depends\n\nfrom deps import require_key\n\nrouter = APIRouter(prefix=\"/admin\", tags=[\"admin\"], dependencies=[Depends(require_key)])\n\n\n@router.get(\"/stats\")\ndef stats():\n    return {\"books\": 2}\n\n\n@router.post(\"/reset\")\ndef reset():\n    return {\"reset\": True}\n```"
    }
